    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 301432585269250
    m_Localized: Close shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306115118837760
    m_Localized: "WASD: walk  \u2022  Mouse: look  \u2022  V: switch view  \u2022  Tab: show cursor  \u2022  O: open/close  \u2022  B: shop  \u2022  Esc: pause"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306115148197888
    m_Localized: "Drag left side: walk  \u2022  Drag right side: look around"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960795156480
    m_Localized: Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933696
    m_Localized: Owner name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933697
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933698
    m_Localized: Owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933699
    m_Localized: Waiter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933700
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933701
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933702
    m_Localized: 'PC: WASD to walk, move the mouse to look around. Click the game to lock the cursor, Tab to free it for buttons. Phone: drag the left half to walk, the right half to look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933703
    m_Localized: Opening the bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933704
    m_Localized: Press Open shop (O) to start a shift and passers-by will come in. Evenings from 17:00 to 23:00 are busiest, late night is quiet. Close whenever you like; seated guests still finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933705
    m_Localized: Serving guests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933706
    m_Localized: 'Seated guests show a bubble with the item they want. Walk up to them to serve it and it appears on the table. The bar under the bubble is their patience: red means they are about to leave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933707
    m_Localized: Taking payment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933708
    m_Localized: After eating, guests show a coin and queue at the cashier. Stand on the circle behind the counter (it turns green) to take payment. If nobody comes, they leave without paying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933709
    m_Localized: Shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933710
    m_Localized: Spend the shop wallet (B) on more tables and a waiter who serves for you. New menu items unlock as total revenue grows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933711
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933712
    m_Localized: V switches between first person and the over-the-shoulder view. Esc pauses the game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
